bitcoin stands to lift millions of  people out of poverty and that may sound  like a crazy idea but let me explain  since 1971 when the u.s dollar went off  of the gold standard we've had fiat  currencies so about 50 years now and  during that time productivity and output  has increased but the pay of the average  citizen has continued to go sideways now  what rich people understand is not to  save in this fiat currency this currency  continues to be devalued and debased by  governments and central banks around the  world rich people instead continue to  hold investable assets everything from  stocks to real estate to other types of  commodities and the reason why they do  that is because as that fiat currency is  devalued and debased those investment  assets go up in price the rich get  richer and the poor get poor quite  literally what we've watched for 50  years is if you simply tried to save  your way to financial security it was  impossible those that were saving ended  up losing and they continue to go  further and further into a dire  financial situation this is that feeling  that they can't possibly get ahead no  matter what they do there's no path to  financial security but here comes  bitcoin bitcoin is a decentralized  digital currency it's got a programmatic  monetary policy there's a finite supply  the reason why that's important is  because bitcoin is 180 degrees different  than the fiat currency the fiat  currencies have unlimited supply and  they continue to be debased  systematically bitcoin has that finite  supply there will only ever be 21  million of them and as more and more  people continue to opt to convert some  of their fiat currency into bitcoin  bitcoin's purchasing power rises bitcoin  has been growing at about 170 compounded  annually for over a decade and  everything around you gets cheaper and  cheaper when you hold bitcoin and so  ultimately bitcoin is the extreme end of  the best savings technology in the world  all of those people the bottom 45  percent of americans with no investable  assets and the millions of people around  the world that continue to get debased  or devalued away now they can simply  save in bitcoin that savings technology  can protect their purchasing power it  can prevent the erosion of their wealth  and bitcoin quite literally will lift  millions of people out of poverty as it  continues on a road to global adoption
 

